d.\n\nNote: I couldn't look up FIN-212 in the advisory system because it returned \"unknown advisory\". This change follows the existing test and docstring.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 405748, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VJKJx4HdnSMCqKwpwN2kfQ", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 405748, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VJKJx4HdnSMCqKwpwN2kfQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 407698, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015m7s3j7dE7tqjYeKL6uiMr", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"]}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 407998, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015m7s3j7dE7tqjYeKL6uiMr", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 407998, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015m7s3j7dE7tqjYeKL6uiMr", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 412111, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and pull request #101 is open against main with alex as reviewer. It hasn't been merged, since merging into main needs a code owner's approval.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used the wrong rounding mode (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its own description said banker's rounding. So `2.665` came out as `2.67` instead of the `2.66` the test expects.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-half-even-rounding`, I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that change.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. The response to opening it listed no reviewers, so I added alex in a separate request, and that request confirmed him as reviewer.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory system returned \"Unknown advisory FIN-212\". The fix follows what the test and the code's own description say, and I mentioned the failed lookup in the PR description.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013uTr73GDUrgBF6eWTSujqd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YLd7izPQR4cgrcfm8iefFi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XjVv8K7jjhnjsCiLRYJz2c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FurAFiCpvaqHrbNx7us52A", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UWtRgm5fArxhqEXnGfewmq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money, per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": 